<main>
<h1 id="renderer-fixture">Renderer fixture</h1>
<!-- doc-links-resolve-from: docs -->
<p>This page exercises every construct <code>axiom doc</code> renders. Its rendered
body is <code>tests/tools/doc-render.golden</code>, so a change to the renderer
is a visible diff.</p>
<h2 id="headings">Headings</h2>
<h3 id="repeated-heading">Repeated heading</h3>
<h3 id="repeated-heading-1">Repeated heading</h3>
<h4 id="fourth-level-with-code-and-emphasis">Fourth level with <code>code</code> and <em>emphasis</em></h4>
<h2 id="paragraphs-and-inline">Paragraphs and inline</h2>
<p>A paragraph with <code>inline code</code>, <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, a <a href="reference.html#if">link to the
reference</a>, a <a href="readme.html#install">link up</a>, a
<a href="contributing.html">contributing link</a>, an
<a href="examples.html">examples link</a>, a
<a href="changelog.html">changelog link</a>, an <a href="#headings">anchor</a>, an
<a href="https://example.com/x?a=1&amp;b=2">external link</a> and an autolink
<a href="https://example.com/auto">https://example.com/auto</a>. A bare <a href="https://example.com/bare">https://example.com/bare</a>. ends a
sentence. Escapes: *not emphasis*, `not code`, a \ backslash.
Entities: 3 &lt; 4 &amp; 5 &gt; 2, a &lt;placeholder&gt; in prose, and <code>a &lt;b&gt; &amp; c</code> in
code. A <code>`backtick`</code> inside code. A lone * star and an
under_score_name.</p>
<p>Raw HTML passes through: <a id="old-anchor"></a> and <!-- a comment -->
and a line break<br> here.</p>
<h2 id="code">Code</h2>
<pre><code class="language-axiom"><span class="d">;;! Module doc line.</span>
<span class="d">;; Doc comment with `code`.</span>
<span class="c">; A plain comment, and #| a block |# comment.</span>
(<span class="k">::</span> main ())
<span class="a">;@axiom:effect(io)</span>
(<span class="k">fn</span> (main)
  {
    (<span class="k">let</span> <span class="k">mut</span> n <span class="n">1</span>)
    (<span class="k">let</span> s <span class="s">&quot;text \&quot;quoted\&quot;&quot;</span>)
    (<span class="k">let</span> c <span class="s">'x'</span>)
    (<span class="k">let</span> f <span class="n">1.5</span>)
    {
      (<span class="k">set</span> n (<span class="o">+</span> n <span class="n">2</span>))
      (<span class="k">if</span> (<span class="o">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class="l">true</span> (<span class="o">!=</span> n <span class="n">0</span>)) (println <span class="s">&quot;{n}&quot;</span>) <span class="n">0</span>)
      (<span class="k">match</span> (<span class="l">Some</span> n) ((<span class="l">Some</span> v) v) ((<span class="l">None</span>) <span class="n">0</span>))
      (<span class="k">fn</span> data data)
    }})
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-axiom">(<span class="k">::</span> half (<span class="o">-&gt;</span> <span class="t">Int</span> <span class="t">Int</span>))
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-axiom">(<span class="k">fn</span> (main) <span class="x">&quot;unterminated
</span></code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-axiom">(<span class="k">data</span> Shape (a) (Circle <span class="t">Float</span>) (Square <span class="t">Int</span>))
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-bash">axiom doc --out /tmp/site --no-open
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="language-text">&lt;main&gt; is escaped &amp; kept
</code></pre>
<pre><code>No info string.
</code></pre>
<pre><code>An indented code block,
kept as is.
</code></pre>
